r inference and reduced size.\n', 'Name:BERT\nDescription:A large Transformer-based language model used as the teacher model in knowledge distillation to train TinyBERT. ; A large Transformer-based language model used as the teacher model in the knowledge distillation process to transfer knowledge to TinyBERT. ; A large Transformer-based language model used as a teacher to transfer knowledge to the smaller TinyBERT model. ; A large Transformer-based language model used as a teacher to transfer knowledge to the TinyBERT student model.\n', 'Name:GLUE BENCHMARK\nDescription:A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of language models on various natural language processing tasks. ; A collection of diverse natural language understanding tasks used to evaluate the performance of TinyBERT and compare it against other models. ; A collection of natural language understanding tasks used to evaluate the performance of language models, including tasks like CoLA, MNLI, and MRPC. ; A collection of natural language understanding tasks used to evaluate the performance of language models, including tasks like MNLI, MRPC, and CoLA.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=43, avg_entity_tokens=60, max_entities=91, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[43]
